      "writtenOn": "2025-12-01T16:35:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I will add the javadocs and rename the method.\n`quotaExceededByLowestAvailableTokensMessage` sounds a bit awkward to me and a bit implementation-oriented imho.\n\nI think a more idiomatic name might be `mostRestrictiveQuotaExceededMessage`.\nI will go with that one for now. Open for discussion if you don\u0027t like it.",
