      "writtenOn": "2025-11-30T10:17:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could you elaborate on that statement?\nAFAIK `sorted()` is slower than `min()`, so I\u0027m not sure why you would prefer to use it.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 131,
        "startChar": 47,
        "endLine": 131,
